    "originalPrompt": "create a food deliviry app : special healthy food in algeria, connect the healthy food with resturant and women bake healthy food in hoses ",
    "generationSummary": "## project-fe167317 - Production React Native App\n\n**App Type**: food\n**Tech Stack**: Expo SDK ~54.0.30, React Native 0.81.5\n\n### Implemented Screens\n- `app/index.tsx` — Splash: full-bleed appetising photo, stacked uppercase headline, language selection (AR/FR/EN), auto-routes after init\n- `app/(auth)/login.tsx` — Phone (+213) login with SMS OTP step, guest browsing\n- `app/(auth)/signup.tsx` — Account creation with full name, phone, wilaya picker (bottom sheet)\n- `app/(tabs)/index.tsx` — Home: location header + search pill, parallax photo hero w/ CTA, goal chip row, kitchen-type toggle, popular dish rail, kitchen cards, trust strip\n- `app/(tabs)/cart.tsx` — Cart grouped by kitchen, steppers, promo code, fee breakdown, delivery address + slot + payment selection, checkout\n- `app/(tabs)/orders.tsx` — Active/Past orders, track + reorder\n- `app/(tabs)/profile.tsx` — Account, dietary profile, addresses, partner entry, settings, language, logout\n- `app/kitchen/[id].tsx` — Kitchen detail: cover photo, verification badges, weekly menu, dish list, dish sheet with nutrition + customizations\n- `app/order/[id].tsx` — Live tracking: MapView with kitchen/courier/dropoff markers, ETA, status timeline\n\n### Key Files & Responsibilities\n- `types/index.ts` — Flat DB-style models (User, Address, Kitchen, Dish, Order, Courier, Review, MealPlan…)\n- `constants/Colors.ts` — Archetype palette (light/dark)\n- `constants/i18n.ts` — Tiny translation table + RTL flag (ar/fr/en)\n- `services/mockData.ts` — Kitchens, dishes, goals, wilayas, orders\n- `store/useAuthStore.ts` — Auth store with separate `isInitializing` / `isSubmitting`\n- `store/useStore.ts` — Cart, orders, favorites, language, simulated live order updates (all async actions)\n- `components/ui/*` — Button, Card, Input, Badge, Skeleton, EmptyState, BottomSheet, PressableScale\n- `components/motion/ParallaxHeader.tsx` — Scroll-linked parallax hero + `useScrollY`, `FadeInView`\n- `components/shared/*` — CategoryRow, KitchenCard, DishCard, PriceAddButton, TrustChips, RewardsStrip, NutritionPanel, StatusIndicator, LocationPicker, CartBadge\n- `app/_layout.tsx` — Root providers + auth guard (splash gated on `isInitializing` only)\n- `app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx` — Custom docked tab bar with raised center cart action + badge\n\n### Design Tokens Applied\n- Theme: Photo Marketplace (archetype: photo-marketplace)\n- Structure: location-search header → photo hero w/ CTA → category row → popular rail → trust strip → docked tabs w/ raised cart\n- Colors: primary #c2410c, secondary #fde8d7, accent #dc2626, canvas #f7f1e8, text #1c1917\n- Typography: display `text-3xl font-extrabold uppercase`, heading `text-lg font-bold`, body `text-sm`, label `text-xs font-medium`\n- Spacing/Radius: 20pt card radius, `shadow-sm`, no borders, 20pt page padding\n\n### Important Patterns & Conventions\n- State: Zustand; all data access via async store actions with try/catch\n- Navigation: Expo Router, only routes that exist\n- Styling: NativeWind classes + a few inline styles for dynamic values\n- Motion: built-in Animated + LayoutAnimation only (no reanimated)\n- IDs: `expo-crypto` `randomUUID()`\n\n### Implemented Features\n- Language select (AR RTL flag / FR / EN), OTP login, guest mode, signup with wilaya\n- Goal chips, kitchen-type toggle, search, favorites, hygiene/halal badges\n- Dish nutrition panel, customizations, multi-kitchen cart, promo (SAHA10), COD / CIB / BaridiMob\n- Delivery slot selection, order placement, live-simulated order tracking with map\n- Orders history with reorder, empty/loading states, pull-to-refresh\n\n### How to Run\n```bash\ncd project-fe167317\nnpm install\nnpx expo start\n```"
  }
